meeting-local
=============

이 저장소의 원저작물(코드·UI·프롬프트·문서·도구 설계)은 DongJu Kim(gggg8657)이 작성했다.
제3자 구성요소는 각자의 라이선스를 따르며 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 에 적었다.
제3자 구성요소의 권리는 이 저장소의 라이선스로 바뀌지 않는다.
연구·내부 시험용 프로토타입이며 배포·상업 서비스용이 아니다.

This package uses (unmodified, installed from PyPI / GitHub releases):

  faster-whisper — https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper — MIT
    Whisper CT2 model weights (Systran/faster-whisper-*) — MIT (OpenAI Whisper)
  sherpa-onnx — https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx — Apache-2.0
    sherpa-onnx-pyannote-segmentation-3-0 — MIT (pyannote/segmentation-3.0, converted to ONNX by k2-fsa)
    3dspeaker_speech_campplus_sv_zh_en_16k-common_advanced.onnx — Apache-2.0 (3D-Speaker, ModelScope)
  ffmpeg — LGPL/GPL (system binary, not bundled)
  PyAV (faster-whisper dependency) — BSD-3-Clause; its PyPI wheel ships FFmpeg (LGPL-3.0+) and libx264/libx265 (GPL-2.0+) shared libraries.
  nvidia-cublas-cu12 / nvidia-cudnn-cu12 — NVIDIA proprietary, installed by setup.sh only when a GPU is present.
    Neither is in this repository; pack.sh bundles wheels — see https://github.com/gggg8657/meeting-local/issues/1 before handing a bundle out.
  kordoc (optional, via ../kordoc-local) — MIT

Files authored for this package (MIT): app.py, ui.html, goal-prompt.md, selftest.py, setup.sh, pack.sh, README.md

LLM (not bundled): called via an OpenAI-compatible API; default deployment is Ollama (https://github.com/ollama/ollama, MIT)
  serving Google Gemma 4 (gemma4:31b, Apache-2.0, https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-31B-it);
  setup.sh pulls Qwen3 (qwen3:8b, Apache-2.0) when Ollama has no model.

